    "effectUnits": ["points", "steps", "share", "coin", "men", "days"],
    "note": "Every skill carries spec (§15.6): cooldown { v, per }, cost [{ res, v }], effect { amount, unit } or { share }, duration { v, unit }, conditions (a list of needs objects). null means none or not yet specified; the first rungs leave them null. Skills have no range (the owner, 2026-11-25: they are used in combat or training); a rare skill may carry reach, a short note, where it truly matters. An active or trigger effect may carry its own spec."
  },
  "caps": {
    "note": "Stacking caps (§2.4), rising by the highest rank among the skills that give the bonus (§15.1). The adapter applies them, so no data can break them.",
    "weights": [1, 0.5, 0.25, 0.125],
